    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hi guys, new update is here!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br>We have made some fundamental design changes to game mechanics, added a tutorial and made some quality of life changes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shooting Mechanics Added</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/40123df161fc5ed6fd5ab9aed73affed.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/40123df161fc5ed6fd5ab9aed73affed.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/40123df161fc5ed6fd5ab9aed73affed.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can now shoot obstacles as long as you can grab those pesky ammo bonuses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Curved Tunnels Added</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Tunnel now curves and bends in uncanny ways, so there is another challenge to your reflexes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Obstacle Variations Added</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f9f58b1e14e90360db9d2be366438cc3.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f9f58b1e14e90360db9d2be366438cc3.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f9f58b1e14e90360db9d2be366438cc3.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>We asked you for feedback and most of you delivered with full force. A common complaint was that game becomes too routine too fast. Well, we have not blessed with his spawn system yet, but we have brought you a large variation of obstacles that is not only amusing too look at but inherently challenging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Power Up Icons Added</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/98c2664c47599877de3eb09f8a090385.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/98c2664c47599877de3eb09f8a090385.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/98c2664c47599877de3eb09f8a090385.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Some of you nicely stated that bonus / power up icons are atrocious to look at. Well, they are not now.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Upgrade Store Design</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f052d1ac7201788c601257db1f74c874.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f052d1ac7201788c601257db1f74c874.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/f052d1ac7201788c601257db1f74c874.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Upgrade store is designed like it's on mobile, so we hope it would be much more convenient.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> There is a tutorial. Yep, you hear that right.<br></li><li> It is now less likely to find a single point to fly by grinding your head on the ceiling, There are some dynamic obstacles, which may or may not be a good idea.<br><br><br>If you have any questions or encounter any bugs, feel free to ask in the forums or hit us up in the discord .<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/36005101705d8b6ad8ec6861aa35c0f0.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p>Hey hey people,<br>First update is here! We made some quality of life changes, added new obstacles and tweaked some mechanics. Here they are:<br>\u2022\tResource gained and score are distinguished<br>\u2022\tMinor revisions to upgrade store interface<br>\u2022\tUpgrade store prices are updated.<br>\u2022\tMusic now starts randomly<br>\u2022\tNew obstacles and obstacle sets are added<br>\u2022\tMin to max speed times are decreased<br>\u2022\tRocket bonus does not shoot and frizzle down when there is no valid targets<br>\u2022\tA truck load of performance improvements<br>\u2022\tMinor bug fixes<br><br>If you have any questions or encounter any bugs, feel free to ask in the forums or hit us up in the discord </p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p>Hey peeps,<br><br>A lot of players and beta testers reported issues about starting the game. We added a loading screen and issue is resolved.<br>We also did some minor quality of life improvements and debugging:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rocket speed is increased so that you can always see what you hit<br></li><li> Issues with buying upgrades are resolved<br></li><li> Some area specific obstacle spawn issues are resolved </li></ul><br>Our primary goal is to perfect spawn system. Planned updates also include a lot of quality of life improvements and content with new modes of interaction. <br><br>Our high king, lord inquisitor is working on revamping the obstacle spawn system. So, hopefully, a new spawn system will be in next update (emphasize on hopefully).<br><br>If you have any questions or encounter any bugs, feel free to ask in the forums or hit us up in the discord </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ICARUS - PRIMA REGULA</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br>You are stuck in a godforsaken spaceship for some reason. The way out seems &quot;too damn long to walk&quot; in technical jargon. Your fortune, however, seems perfectly balanced. On one hand' you come by a jetpack that has not have all the life squeezed out of it. On the other, when you start there are no breaks. You smash into something face-first you are going to... not die? Also, there are lasers which is nice.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Icarus - Prima Regula is an infinite runner  shooter mix in which player flies through procedurally generated spaceship corridors with a jetpack. Avoid obstacles or blow them up, purchase upgrades and go as far as you can in this simple but fast paced flight experience. What brought you to this spaceship and why it did exactly that, are yet to be discovered. Yet, something or someone is trying to prevent your escape but  keep you flying.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/36005101705d8b6ad8ec6861aa35c0f0.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ICARUS - PRIMA REGULA</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/42f09af30130250fda342551860c59cb.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div><br>You are stuck in a godforsaken spaceship for some reason. The way out seems &quot;too damn long to walk&quot; in technical jargon. Your fortune, however, seems perfectly balanced. On one hand' you come by a jetpack that has not have all the life squeezed out of it. On the other, when you start there are no breaks. You smash into something face-first you are going to... not die? Also, there are lasers which is nice.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.poster.avif?t=1570518482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.webm?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/c16bae1e649e13c1c11dae0927f16d07.mp4?t=1570518482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Icarus - Prima Regula is an infinite runner  shooter mix in which player flies through procedurally generated spaceship corridors with a jetpack. Avoid obstacles or blow them up, purchase upgrades and go as far as you can in this simple but fast paced flight experience. What brought you to this spaceship and why it did exactly that, are yet to be discovered. Yet, something or someone is trying to prevent your escape but  keep you flying.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055180/extras/36005101705d8b6ad8ec6861aa35c0f0.webp?t=1570518482\" /></div>",
